<p>
Yankee go home / choked with tourists 
Hassle of getting through the historic parts of town 
No taxi to dinner

Great view from the terrace and bonus unexpected fireworks
Laundry dried by Tuscan sun
Mosquito sleep
Two great rides outside of town, but no cycle facilities there
Seemingly great facilities in town but half are blocked by construction or under construction.  Waiting quite a long time at every intersection crossing and short light for peds and bikes even after the wait
Folks walking in cycletracks
Traffic management is poor for the number of users
Hot but temperature could be rather higher to be more like what id consider really hot.  Glad it isn't like that! 
Interesting for like tripe but maybe best discovery is the salted beer.  More pasticcerias for breakfast.

(Picture of the sun behind the cross)
Duomo with its massive fresco, 3600m2
Interesting museum of the cathedral with many details about construction but also just Catholic relics.  So many reliquaries with bits of old dudes (mostly dudes) in em

Holy huge Florentine steak for last night dinner in Florence
